-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The certificate authorities of Mozilla (std/koji/roots.kj)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The subjects and public keys of the certificate authorities that std/http.kj
trusts when the system names none come from the list of Mozilla (the file
cacert.pem that curl extracts from it, https://curl.se/docs/caextract.html),
made available under the Mozilla Public License 2.0
(https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). Its source is the file certdata.txt of NSS:
https://hg.mozilla.org/projects/nss/raw-file/tip/lib/ckfw/builtins/certdata.txt

